{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼祝／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなタピオカの味はー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブラックタピオカに紅芋ミルク♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかってあだ名変わったの？\n前はまりっかじゃなくて、\nどんなあだ名だったの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期はあだ名が\n「べびたん」でした。\nでも...これはもう黒歴史です...←\n今はまりっかだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校に行くときは髪型は\nどうしてますか？\n通学鞄はデコったりしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろでぴっちり結んでます。\n鞄にデコる...？！\nストラップ一個です。\nなんか地味ですみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自撮りってどーやったら\n上手くできるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"激おこぷんぷん丸って\n分かりますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからん。ポップだね！\n本当に怒ってるん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達の家に泊まったりしたとき\n夜遅くまで起きていられる方？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃ、お泊まり会は\nテンション上がるでしょう！\n楽しいでしょう！ガールズトーク！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人暮らしでとても寂しい俺に\n万理華から一言ください！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いないいないばー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ読んで元気になって！ね？\n私の手料理届けにいくよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DDだけどまりっ会入ってもいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントでもあったのですが\n下北FMでDD嫌いとか言って\nショックを受けてる方が...><\n私も流れで言ってしまったので\n全く本心ではないのです。\n大蔵さんをからかったのです。\nごめんなさい><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからDDでも大歓迎"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もDDです。みんなかわいいもん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜモロッコに行きたいん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モロッコ料理と、雑貨！すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、スマホの待ち受けは\nどんなやつにしてる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苔。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日同じく400回目の更新を迎えた\n深川さんに何か一言お願いします。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいまいまいまいまいまいまい\n一緒に買い物行きたいーなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな数字は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2\n単純に誕生日が2月20日だから。\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はいよいよ\n「アオーレ1周年誕生祭」！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに公開生放送"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ楽しみ楽しみ楽しみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新潟のみなさん！\n待ってろよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩を美白に加工したのは内緒。でへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張りまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/05/6855222/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}